# --- Room 1/18 ---
dig Brimstone Foothills - Entrance
@desc A ethereal chamber opens before you, dominated by a corrupted magma vent. You hear distant howls of majestic power reverberating through the rock, and see a dark bloodstain glowing with inner fire.
@tags/set room-zone:brimstone_foothills
@open south=south to Brimstone Foothills - Hollow
@open east=east to Brimstone Foothills - Overlook

# --- Room 2/18 ---
